      "page": 379,
      "ruku": 328,
      "hizbQuarter": 152,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3188,
      "text": "The Queen said, “O chiefs, a noble letter has been delivered to me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 379,
      "ruku": 328,
      "hizbQuarter": 152,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3189,
      "text": "It is from Solomon, and it reads, ‘In the name of Allah, the Most Compassionate, the Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 379,
      "ruku": 328,
      "hizbQuarter": 152,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3190,
      "text": "Do not be arrogant towards me, but come to me in full submission.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 379,
      "ruku": 328,
      "hizbQuarter": 152,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3191,
      "text": "She said, “O chiefs, advise me in this matter of mine, for I would make no decision without your consent[7].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 379,
      "ruku": 329,
      "hizbQuarter": 152,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3192,
      "text": "They said, “We are powerful and great fighters, but the decision is yours, so consider what you will command.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 379,
      "ruku": 329,
      "hizbQuarter": 152,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3193,
      "text": "She said, “When kings enter a town, they ravage it and humiliate its notables; this is what they really do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
